This device was not granted the executable-memory permission, so Java's just-in-time compiler (JIT) cannot be used and the game runs interpreted instead.

⚠️ That is a restriction of the system, not a problem with this app.

What it means:
· the game is noticeably slower, more so the more units are on screen;
· measured: load time goes from about 5-6 s to around 20 s;
· a smaller game window helps a lot -- the cost scales with how much you can see.
